# cn-telemetry-collectors — QUARANTINE (candidate entries, NOT active)
#
# Same format as telemetry.domains. Entries here are compiled into nothing by
# default; weekly CI drops new auto-discovered candidates here. A human reviews
# the evidence and promotes qualifying entries to telemetry.domains via PR
# (moving the line to the STABLE file and updating `added`).
#
# Typical reasons an entry lives here instead of STABLE:
#   - single source only, awaiting a second corroboration
#   - probe evidence ambiguous (large GET / body, mixed signals)
#   - CN endpoint where http probing is inconclusive (https-only / connection
#     drops) and device-side behavioral evidence is still being collected

